  'What Is System Design?': ['Two services both accept ownership of the same reservation.', 'Choose one authoritative reservation boundary and define the success contract.', 'A topology diagram does not enforce business invariants by itself.', 'Submit conflicting requests and inspect the single accepted reservation.', 'Add independent writers and reconcile exclusive promises after acceptance.'],
